- [n] mini.git           Git integration
  - [*] => use https://github.com/neogitorg/neogit
- [n] mini.jump          Jump to next/previous single character
  - [*] => use built-in `f`/`F`/`t`/`T`
- [n] mini.jump2d        Jump within visible lines
  - [*] => use folke/flash.nvim
- [n] mini.misc          Miscellaneous functions
  - [*] => not needed
- [n] mini.pick          Pick anything
